    "work_id": "npnf-works/cyril-of-alexandria-canonical-epistles",
    "canonical_ref": "CyrAlex.EpCan.Domn.3.s6",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "Peter had indeed signed an instrument of resignation; but Cyril says, that he was terrified into it; and that he would have no such resignation be of force except he that made it deserved deposition.",
